    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inye Petero, entumwa ya Yesu Kirisito, n'inye ndikubahandikira inywe bazahe abenaganagire, abali Ponto, Galasia, Kapadokia, Asia na Bitinia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga Isheichwe akabaronka aina omugendelero aha rwanyu, kandi Mwoyo yabahindura batakatifu kamugira omuhuliro ahali Yesu Kirisito mukashuba mukahasilirwa obwambabwe. Mugire omugisha gungi n'emilembe etali mike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakasinge Ruhanga Ishe Omukama waitu Yesu Kirisito! Aha rw'obuganyizibwe obungi tukazarwa bundi buhya, twagira eshubi ey'ebiro byona aha rw'okuba Yesu Kirisito akahimbuka omu bafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara aho tulindiliire obusika obw'eira lyona, obutainamu kamogo, obutahwaho. Obusika obwo mwabutekatekeirwe omw'iguru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inywe abo Ruhanga alikulinda omu bushobora bwa wenene aha rw'okwesiga kwanyu, mushobore kurokoka omu kurokoka okulimanyika aha maheleruka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo mushemelerwe, n'orwo rundi mwakuragirwa kushashaho akabanga kake omu biyengo ebitali bimoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiyengo ebyo nibibagumisa omu kwesiga, okwesiga kuba kw'eiguzi kushaaga ezahabu ehwaho n'orwo bagijuguta omu muliro. Orwo Yesu Kirisito aliija okwesiga kwanyu kulibasiimisa, kulibabonesa ekitinwa, kulibaha okukunirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe timukamubonaga kyonkai nimumugonza. N'orwo mutalikumubona mwaha nimumwesiga mara mwina n'amashemelerwa agatali ga kugambwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwesiga kwanyu kulibarugiramu okurokora emyoyo yanyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarangi abarangaga omugisha ogwo mwabaire nimwija kugilirwa, bakabaza mara banyomoza aha burokozi obu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahenjuzaga ni muntu wa ngeliki n'amakiroki ebyo Mwoyo wa Kirisito ayabaire abasingiiremu yabashuruliraga, akabamanyisa n'obushasi bwa Kirisito butakabaireho, n'ekitinwakye ekilikuhonderaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakashuruliwa bamanya okwo omulimo gw'oburangi babaire batalikugukora aha bwabo; bakaba nibagukora aha bwanyu, baranga amakuru ago mwagambiirwe ababarangiire evangeli omu mani ga Mwoyo Mutakatifu owo mwatwekeirwe kuruga omw'iguru, amakuru ago abamalaika bagonza kubona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo mweyememu mugume emitima, mwelinde muno, mushubire omugisha ogwo mulikwija kutungwa aha maija ga Yesu Kirisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mube baana b'omuhuliro, mutegarukana bunyama obwo mwagiraga aha rw'obutamanya bwanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu ntwaza zanyu zona mube batakatifu nka Ruhanga ayabesire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikahandikwa kiti, “Mube batakatifu, aha rw'okuba inye mba Mutakatifu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi kamuratakira Ruhanga aramura buli omoi kuhondera ebikorwabye, atamugiliire kigonzi, niwe Isheichwe, murarora kurungi nimumutina ebiro byona orwo muli omu buzahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimumanya okwo mwachungwirwe omu michwo yanyu etaina mugasho eyo mwaihire ahali bashw'enkurw'inywe. Timwachunguziibwe bintu ebihwaho nk'efeza n'ezahabu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukachunguzibwa obwamba bwa Kirisito obw'eiguzi lihango, nk'obw'akataama akataina kamogo anga katalizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenene akamanyika karai ensi etakatonzirwe, kyonkai yaija yaboneka orwo obukiro bwagobire aha rwanyu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inywe abo yashoboize kwesiga Ruhanga, ayamuhimbwire omu bafu akamutunga n'ekitiinwa, okwesiga kwanyu kubone kuba niyo shubi yanyu omuli Ruhanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu orwo mwamazire kuba batakatifu aha rw'okugira omuhuliro aha mazima, kushobora kugonza barumuna baanyu obumaramunda, mugonzangane muno engonzi ezilikuruga aha mutima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukazarwa bundi buhya mutarugire mu mbibo elikufa, mukaruga omu mbibo etafa, nikyo kigambo kya Ruhanga ekigiza oburora mara eky'eirai lyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nobona,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
